{"id":"u-c0273068-ce90-4ac8-bbd7-ec02c366c91b","src":"community","title":"5-Day Push/Pull/Legs Split","author":"Gianflavio Gordillo","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/85AguZ-5-day-pushpulllegs-split","desc":"This version of the PPL split is a pure 5-day version, where you have 5 total workouts per week, every single week.\n\nThis is done using a schedule where you have two consecutive workouts… followed by a day off… followed by three consecutive workouts… followed by a day off.\n\nThen you repeat it again.\n\nAnd unlike the previous version, the 5 workout days fall on the same days each week. In the example shown, Monday, Tuesday, Thursday, Friday and Saturday are always the training days, and Wednesday and Sunday are always the the rest days. (Note that the workouts themselves still vary, as one week Monday is a “push” workout, and the next Monday is a “legs” workout.)\n\n(https://www.aworkoutroutine.com/push-pull-legs-split/)","level":["Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T15:36:27.365Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push A","Pull A","Legs","Legs","Push B","Pull B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Seated Overhead Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher To Pullover","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Lat Pulldown (Close Grip)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Straight Arm Pulldown","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"T-Bar Row","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Preacher Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Wrist Curls","sets"